  "decision_conditions": [
    "Given its excessive width and location in relation to the road, the proposed single storey side extension would result in an insubordinate and overly dominant addition to the detriment of the character and appearance of the wider area. The proposal is therefore contrary to the objectives of the National Planning Policy Framework, Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and the guidance contained within SPD 4 'Design of Residential Extensions'."
